WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.199 --> 00:00:05.399
The electric car maker Tesla is set to open
its first European factory in the coming weeks.

00:00:05.399 --> 00:00:10.550
The company has thrown a party to unveil its
new plant just outside Berlin – but it's

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:12.519
not without controversy.

00:00:12.519 --> 00:00:17.560
Environmental concerns mean its construction
has not yet been given final approval – but

00:00:17.560 --> 00:00:22.060
that hasn't deterred Tesla founder Elon Musk.

00:00:22.060 --> 00:00:28.340
Nobody could accuse Elon Musk of being short
on ambition, or showmanship, for that matter.

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:34.460
And his plans for the new Tesla factory just
outside Berlin are characteristically big.

00:00:34.460 --> 00:00:39.600
"We're expecting to have on the order of 12000
jobs, maybe more.

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:43.250
In fact, I'm a little worried we won't be
able to hire enough people.

00:00:43.250 --> 00:00:48.370
So really kind of need great talent to come
here from all around Europe."

00:00:48.370 --> 00:00:53.560
A fairground atmosphere prevailed in the factory
forecourt, drawing in curious visitors and

00:00:53.560 --> 00:00:56.900
Musk fans from Berlin and further afield.

00:00:56.900 --> 00:01:02.200
Some had queued since early in the morning,
to get a sneak peek behind the scenes, temperatures

00:01:02.200 --> 00:01:06.210
close to freezing couldn’t dampen their
enthusiasm.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:10.719
Emil and Erno were among the thousands who
made the pilgrimage.

00:01:10.719 --> 00:01:13.509
"I'm excited.

00:01:13.509 --> 00:01:16.640
Because I'm here for the first time in a couple
of months.

00:01:16.640 --> 00:01:25.299
And the last time I was here it was just a
clean field with some trees.

00:01:25.299 --> 00:01:27.409
And now the factory is here."

00:01:27.409 --> 00:01:31.989
The factory aims to deliver up to half a million
electric cars a year to the European market

00:01:31.989 --> 00:01:38.100
- Musk says the first cars should roll off
the assembly line in just six weeks' time.

00:01:38.100 --> 00:01:44.249
But for many, Tesla is more than just a car
maker – it is a complete concept for a hi-tech

00:01:44.249 --> 00:01:45.789
green future.

00:01:45.789 --> 00:01:49.710
"We are part of the Tesla owner Club.

00:01:49.710 --> 00:01:52.979
There's a huge following, huge number of these
people that actually bought the cars.

00:01:52.979 --> 00:01:56.679
But actually bought into more than the car,
but in the vision of the company itself."

00:01:56.679 --> 00:02:00.429
Despite the hype, the project has encountered
stiff opposition.

00:02:00.429 --> 00:02:05.990
The plant is nearly finished, but Tesla was
never officially granted a construction permit.

00:02:05.990 --> 00:02:09.569
Some are angry that the factory lies in a
protected water catchment.

00:02:09.569 --> 00:02:13.090
German authorities are still examining objections.

00:02:13.090 --> 00:02:17.450
"Our demand that the factory be dismantled
has not changed.

00:02:17.450 --> 00:02:21.510
It sits in the middle of a water-protection
area – a huge breach of law and a danger

00:02:21.510 --> 00:02:26.849
to the main water source for 70,000 people."

00:02:26.849 --> 00:02:30.129
Elon Musk is not concerned about the criticism.

00:02:30.129 --> 00:02:34.531
In halting German he thanked his adoring fans,
and urged them to join the party.

00:02:34.531 --> 00:02:39.250
"Diese Party ist für euch"
Visionary pioneer?

00:02:39.250 --> 00:02:40.340
Savvy businessman?

00:02:40.340 --> 00:02:42.939
Or just another eccentric billionaire?

00:02:42.939 --> 00:02:48.770
Elon Musk has polarized the world with his
unorthodox style and ambitious ventures.

00:02:48.770 --> 00:02:52.010
The new Tesla factory outside Berlin is no
exception.

